SUMMARY:18th Annual Run for the Reef: 10K / 5K / Kids Fun Run
LOCATION:Navarre Beach Marine Park / Windjammers on the Pier area\, Gulf Bl
 vd\, Navarre Beach\, FL 32566 (exact start-line street number not publishe
 d)
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/10 · Race-day registration 6:00-7:00 AM · 10K/5K 
 start 7:30 AM · Kids Fun Run about 9:00 AM\n\nThe Navarre Beach Marine Sa
 nctuary's 18th annual reef-benefit race offers a 10K\, a 5K and a one-mile
  kids Fun Run starting from the Marine Park/Windjammers pier area\, with e
 ntry fees that climb in three tiers as race day approaches. The kids run\,
  capped at age 12\, is a flat $20 including a T-shirt. Food\, refreshments
  and an awards ceremony follow at Windjammers.\n\nPrice: from $20\n\nDetai
 ls: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-navarre-runforthereef.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-navarre-runforthereef.html
CATEGORIES:Beach
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
