UID:ev_18th_annual_run_for_the_reef_1010-2026-10-10@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261010T073000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261010T083000
SUMMARY:Run for the Reef\, 18th year
LOCATION:Windjammers on the Pier\, 8579 Gulf Blvd\, Navarre\, FL 32566
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/10 · 7:30 AM\n\nA 10K\, a 5K run and walk\, and a 
 one mile fun run for ages twelve and under\, all starting from the pier at
  Navarre Beach. The 5K and 10K run out and back along Gulf Blvd. The fun r
 un goes off on the Sea Turtle Center nature trail once the 5K has cleared.
  The money pays for the Navarre Beach Marine Sanctuary's snorkelling and d
 iving reefs\, so the race funds the reef it's named after. An after-race p
 arty follows with food and refreshments.\n\nPrice: $ TBA\n\nDetails: https
 ://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-18th-annual-run-for-the-reef-1010.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-18th-annual-run-for-the-reef-101
 0.html
CATEGORIES:Beach
